# Cloud Build upload list for the AGENT service.
#
# ⚠️ THIS FILE MUST EXIST. Without it `gcloud run deploy --source` falls back to .gitignore,
# which excludes data/ -- and data/ is where the Qdrant index, the LEIE csv and the provider
# lookup live. The build would then SUCCEED and ship a service with no index and no records,
# reporting nothing wrong. The same trap cost an hour on the insurance project.

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
.venv/
notebooks/
mlruns/
qdrant_storage/
docs/
logs/
*.log

# The 60 MB, 331-column dataset. The agent reads the 8.3 MB provider_lookup.parquet instead;
# shipping both would triple the image for nothing.
data/processed/labelled_dataset.parquet

# The scorer's own service builds from serving/ with its own Dockerfile.
serving/Dockerfile
serving/requirements.txt
serving/*_superseded.*
serving/server.log
